ived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clintongormley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-11-06T09:57:32Z","updated_at":"2016-11-06T09:57:32Z","body":"Updated for 5.0.  Another example where the plain highlighter does a better job the FVH:\n\n```\nPUT /foo\n{\n  \"mappings\": {\n    \"bar\": {\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"content\": {\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"fields\": {\n            \"fvh\": {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"term_vector\": \"with_positions_offsets\"\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nPUT /foo/bar/1\n{\n  \"content\": \"North Atlantic Treaty Organization, Zwei, Drei, Vier, Fünf, Sechs, Sieben, Acht, Neun\"\n}\n\nPOST /foo/bar/_search\n{\n  \"query\": {\n    \"match\": {\n      \"content\": \"North Zwei Vier Drei Sechs Sieben Acht Neun\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"highlight\": {\n    \"fields\": {\n      \"content\": {\n        \"fragment_size\": 50,\n        \"number_of_fragments\": 5\n      },\n      \"content.fvh\": {\n        \"require_field_match\": false,\n        \"fragment_size\": 50,\n        \"number_of_fragments\": 5\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/comments/258668143/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"clintongormley","id":56599,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NTk5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56599?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clintongormley","html_url":"https://github.com/clintongormley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clintongormley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clintongormley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clintongormley/gi